Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.71,0:38:44.61,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}We drew some pictures of mountains and flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.09,0:38:51.18,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I felt like time flied when it was beautiful
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.31,0:38:53.87,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.05,0:38:57.16,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}We walked around singing a song
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.37,0:39:00.16,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.26,0:39:06.18,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}A quiet talk made us know each other
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.40,0:39:09.90,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}You might know what I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.09,0:39:16.11,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Sometimes destiny is cruel and cold
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.36,0:39:21.82,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}But I wish I could be with you forever
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.99,0:39:24.67,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Hi, you
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.19,0:39:28.01,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Let's smile like the sun
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.12,0:39:30.40,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}And sing like a bird
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.40,0:39:33.85,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}And walk like a cloud
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.31,0:39:39.41,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}All of you will be memories
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.41,0:39:48.96,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}And I want to remember to the end of time
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.70,0:39:52.40,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.40,0:39:55.75,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}We made a promise to come back
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.84,0:39:58.60,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Memories
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.69,0:40:04.79,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I have been waiting for you ever since
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.87,0:40:08.29,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}On this wonderful day
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.52,0:40:14.46,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}I wish you stayed alive
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.86,0:40:41.78,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Even if the sun never rises
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.01,0:40:47.59,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Even if the birds disappear
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.15,0:40:56.28,INJP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\blur3}Even if the sky is covered with the black clouds
